# 21. CRD vs CR vs Controller

This distinction is extremely important:

```text
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ CRD                           │
│ Defines the resource type     │
└───────────────┬───────────────┘
                │
                ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Custom Resource (CR)          │
│ Actual instance/data          │
└───────────────┬───────────────┘
                │
                │ watched by
                ▼
┌───────────────────────────────┐
│ Controller / Operator         │
│ Implements business logic     │
└───────────────┬───────────────┘
                │
                ▼
      Kubernetes Resources
       ├── Deployment
       ├── Service
       ├── PVC
       ├── Secret
       └── Pods
```

### In one line:

**CRD defines → CR represents → Controller reconciles.**

